# Key Algorithms to Implement Correctly

These are the most important logic areas to get right.

## 1. XP Calculation
- Only completed 10-minute blocks count
- Partial blocks are discarded
- XP is whole number only

## 2. Daily Medal Calculation
- Sum all sessions attributed to the day
- Apply thresholds:
  - ≥ 120 minutes = Bronze
  - ≥ 180 minutes = Silver
  - ≥ 300 minutes = Gold
- Return only highest medal

## 3. Day Attribution
- Use start datetime date only
- Do not split sessions across midnight

## 4. Current Streak
- Build set of qualifying dates with ≥ 10 minutes
- If today qualifies, start counting backward from today
- If today does not qualify, start counting backward from yesterday
- Stop at first missing qualifying day

## 5. Longest Streak
- Examine all qualifying dates
- Find longest consecutive sequence

## 6. Weekly Stats
- Week starts Monday
- Week ends Sunday
- Use local dates only

## 7. Average Daily Time
- Total study time ÷ number of active days
- Active day means at least one session exists for that date

