# Risks and Mitigations

## Risk 1 — CustomTkinter Packaging Issues
**Risk:** Assets or theme resources fail in frozen build  
**Mitigation:**
- use one-folder build for v1
- centralize resource path resolution
- test packaged app early, not only at the end

## Risk 2 — Date Edge Cases
**Risk:** Midnight-crossing or week/month boundaries are calculated incorrectly  
**Mitigation:**
- keep all core logic date-based and local
- add explicit unit tests for edge cases

## Risk 3 — Save Corruption
**Risk:** Crash or failed write damages default save  
**Mitigation:**
- atomic writes
- backup strategy
- preserve/quarantine corrupt files

## Risk 4 — Derived Data Becomes Stale
**Risk:** UI shows outdated totals/medals after deletion  
**Mitigation:**
- refresh all views after any data mutation
- derive values from single source of truth

## Risk 5 — Performance with Large History
**Risk:** Calendar/stats slow down with many sessions  
**Mitigation:**
- performance pass
- optional in-memory daily index

